---
layout: layout.njk
title: Offer book
description: Eight student offers, verified 2026-08-18. Names as type.
permalink: /offer-book/index.html
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Offer book
  order: 50
bodyClass: page-offers
---
<header class="page-hero">
  <p class="kicker">Offer book · eight · verified 2026-08-18</p>
  <h1>Eight student offers, as type.</h1>
  <p class="lede">No partner marks. No invented prices. Each card is a name, a term, a door.</p>
</header>
<div class="offer-grid">
  {% for offer in offers %}
  <article class="offer-card">
    <p class="kicker">{{ offer.counterpart }}</p>
    <h2><a href="/offer-book/{{ offer.slug }}/">{{ offer.title }}</a></h2>
    <p class="offer-term">{{ offer.terms }}</p>
    <p>{{ offer.summary }}</p>
    <p class="actions">
      <a class="btn" href="{{ offer.href }}" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the vendor door</a>
    </p>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
